{“Background”: (“Carmen was born into the Aguilar Family, who, to the general public, were known for their influence on the Hotel business, having a Hotel chain running through Mexico & Southern Texas. But to other people, the Aguilar was more known as the 'Rosa Esmeralda', a dying Spanish mafia family who specialized in prostitution with drug distribution on the side.

