Carmen made big changes to not only the Hotel front that her family put up to hide their illegal business, but also to the Mafia side of her business. First, Carmen got rid of the prostitution and focused solely on drug distribution, where she slowly built up her drug enterprise. She expanded out into the United States & South America, owning territory in California, Texas, New Mexico, Arizona & Nevada, along with territory in Venezsula, Colombia & Ecuador, making the Rosa Esmeralda one of the most powerful mafia families in the world.

Carmen also improved the Hotel side of her business. She changed the themes and designs to reflect her Mexican heritage, which she takes great pride in. She also expanded out to have hotels all over North America, making her a well-known figure in the public. All of her hotel's are either 4 or 5 stars, nothing lower, which she also takes great pride in.

Through the years, Carmen has hardened into a cold, stern woman who could intimidate with only a subtle glance. Carmen is a very driven woman, even back when she was a teenager, when she gained control of Rosa Esmeralda, she worked hard to not only make her men respect her, but to build herself up to power. 

Carmen also has a distinct love for the lavish lifestyle as during business, she wears expensive suits with expensive watches and jewelry. She's usually chauffeured around in luxury Cadillac SUV's and she enjoys exotic meals from all around the world.”)}

